# The remaining compiled Go binaries `go build ./...` drops in each module root.
# ~28 MB of these were committed once and still weigh on every clone; the two
# module outputs that were not yet covered are listed here so none can be
# re-added. (packages/eval-engine/eval-engine and tools/relay/relay are already
# ignored above; tools/parlay-bin also carries its own nested .gitignore, and the
# entry here keeps every module's binary path visible in this one file.)
tools/cli/cli
tools/parlay-bin/parlay-bin
